-- statement:
--   **Idempotents of equal rank are similar.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.R6BitNBSim`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem IntMul.Kappa.R6.Bit.NB.idem_similar (A B : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin n) ℚ) (hA : A * A = A) (hB : B * B = B)
--       (hr : A.rank = B.rank) : ∃ Q : Matrix (Fin n) (Fin n) ℚ, IsUnit Q.det ∧ Q * A = B * Q
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** Round six, bit network: similarity of idempotents, explicit corner idempotent, transitivity
--
--   * `idem_similar`: idempotent matrices over `ℚ` of equal rank are similar.
--   * `eIdem n r`: an explicit idempotent of rank `r` whose top-right `(n-r)`-corner is the identity
--     (for `n < 2r`).
--   * `conj_rank_one`: for `y ⬝ x = 1 = y' ⬝ x'` some invertible `Q` has `Q (x yᵀ) Q⁻¹ = x' y'ᵀ`.
